      "text": "The NEET-UG medical entrance exam descended into chaos as the system was compromised by rule-breakers, forcing authorities to confront a systemic failure. To restore order, the national testing agency acted decisively, transferring the case to central investigators who swiftly moved to contain the scandal. This led to the arrest of thirteen individuals, including a former advocate of student justice, marking a clear attempt to reassert control over the compromised examination process.",
