      "text": "The discovery of leaked exam materials revealed a profound breach of institutional integrity. In response, the examination authority and central law enforcement intervened as instruments of restoration, their actions aimed at clearing the sources of disorder. The cancellation of the tainted exam and the scheduling of a new one represent a deliberate reestablishment of a stable, orderly system for candidates across the nation.",
